<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Pantry Shelf Spacing and Depth Guide</h2>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Good pantry shelves are planned around what you store. Cans need very little height, cereal boxes need more, and small appliances need the most. Depth matters just as much: shelves that are too deep make it easy to lose things at the back.</p>



